        "description": "Turn voice notes into clear next steps\n\nShare from WhatsApp, choose an audio file, or record here.\n\n• Word-for-word transcript\n• Summary and key points\n• Action items and dates\n• Suggested replies\n\nDrag both handles to choose the part you want summarized. You can play it before continuing.\n\nAudio is used temporarily for transcription, then deleted automatically. Only a brief and transcript you choose to save can remain in history.\n\nAn internet connection and an Apple or Google account are required. Some sections and reply styles require VoiceBrief Pro. Review AI-generated words and dates before relying on them. Legal and support pages are available in Arabic and English.\n\nhttps://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\n\nhttps://voicebrief-legal.vercel.app/privacy?lang=en",
